<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/1/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Upon receipt of a written invitation sent by the person initiating the mediation under subsection (1), the person with whom he has a dispute may, in writing, accept the written invitation."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/1/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/1/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/1/eng@/~part_II__cl_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/1/eng@> .
