<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/1/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "A mediation shall be deemed to have been commenced upon the person initiating the mediation receiving the acceptance of the written invitation from the person with whom he has a dispute under subsection (3)."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/1/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/1/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/1/eng@/~part_II__cl_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/1/eng@> .
