<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/1/eng@/~part_II__cl_6__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Upon the commencement of a mediation as specified under subsection 5(4), the parties shall enter into a mediation agreement."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/1/eng@> .
